  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A step in refining star thought Immortal Gu needs a portion of pale flame white bones together with a portion of green beetle water lotuses. Pale flame white bones are a fire path immortal material and carry fire path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        926
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "star-thought-step",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_star_thought_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The two immortal materials must be processed at the same time so water and fire fuse into a clear liquid. Fire path dao marks on the pale flame white bone and water path dao marks on the green beetle water lotus must be equal, or nearly so; if one side is too high, the liquid turns murky and cannot be used. The Immortal Gu recipe states the amount of pale flame white bones; damage to the bones reduces the dao marks on them.",
      "chapters": [
        926
      ],
